  {
    "@id": "ArtifactNode:00CE01XZ8G000",
    "@type": "ArtifactNode",
    "title": "archive-migration.md",
    "text": "**`Aperas-design.md` needs a dedicated brainstorm, not a mechanical split**: unlike every other doc in this migration, it doesn't map cleanly onto one subsystem's design/issues/planning/history/discussion shape — see [Open Questions](../discussion/archive-migration.md#id/BlockNode:00CE0HD0H8001). (`Aperas-dev-status.md` is no longer grouped here — it's TDB-era in origin and follows that era's settled approach; see [design](../design/archive-migration.md#id/BlockNode:00CE0HPRV8001).)",
    "parent": "FolderNode:00CDBYV4BR003",
    "type": "root",
    "children": [
