  {
    "@id": "ArtifactNode:00CE1GW4B8002",
    "@type": "ArtifactNode",
    "title": "treeview.md",
    "text": "The `Profile`/`TreeView` data model, three-tier rendering, canonical-position rule, viewcone zoom, and the `.state/` vs. tracked-mirror git split are all implemented and live-verified (against a synthetic graph exercising every scenario the design doc worked through by hand — not yet exercised against the real `AperasKG/Apeiron/` corpus, which has no live wikilinks yet to actually escape a viewcone with). `Profile`/`kg:profile` and the upward-pointing-link fix in viewcone zoom, both originally tracked as \"designed, not yet implemented,\" are confirmed fully built — see Milestones. Three real gaps remain open: stale `TreeView.unfolds` references, a bare `aperas unfold` wrongly mutating the default view, and no raw single-node inspection command — see [Issues](../issues/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CE1GW638002).",
    "parent": "FolderNode:00CDBYV4BR002",
    "type": "root",
